  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Humanitarian Response and Sustainability  (SURE-SN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will achieve a higher standard of well-being based on the identified multi-sector purpose to integrate services and resilience in conflict-affected and displaced communities with health, nutrition, WASH, protection services as the most critical lifesaving, sustainable priorities for the program.</narrative>
